{"product":{"id":9728668532961,"title":"JEFFREY 98","body_html":"<p>The Jeffrey 98 is our new progressive all-mountain freestyle ski: a 98mm twin built to go anywhere and be skied every day.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Jeffrey 98 receives an updated Bi-Radius Sidecut, a stiffer core profile, and our Delta Taper. Combined with Signature Rocker, these updates create one of the most stable and responsive all-mountain freestyle twins we’ve ever built. The added torsional stiffness improves edge hold and stability, while the tapered tail makes the ski easier to pivot and release in trees and tight terrain. A compact turning radius and wide shovel let it carve hard while retaining useful float in softer snow. Its 98mm width serves skiers on both coasts. The Jeffrey 98 crushes hardpack, pow, park, crud, and everything in between: our most versatile option for freestyle skiers who need a quiver of one.</p>\n<p>Every Jeffrey 98 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, playful, and durable do-it-all freestyle ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:21-07:00","handle":"jeffrey-98","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:36-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Jeffrey, Stock Ski","variants":[{"id":49128507146465,"product_id":9728668532961,"title":"161cm / Onyx","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PJF98161","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"161cm","option2":"Onyx","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:21-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:40-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":3,"old_inventory_quantity":3,"requires_shipping":true,"